  m get_text_embedding_batch(texts: list[str]) -> list[list[float]] ! TypeError, ProviderError ~net :: Return the embeddings of ``texts``, in requests of 64 at most

C HashEmbedder :: Deterministic offline embedder: a bag of hashed words, L2-normalised
  reg: embedder[hash]
