  m complete_json(messages: Sequence[PromptMessage]) -> str ! TypeError, ValueError, ProviderError ~net :: Send ``messages`` to Ollama and return the content of its reply

C EchoJudgeClient :: Offline judge: a valid, deterministic JSON reply for every judge operation
  reg: judge_client[echo]
  a model: str = "echo"
